# Public repo only

phototag on GitHub is a **generic** local vision tagging tool.

## Never commit

- Real `categories.txt`, tag hint text, NSFW tag IDs in scripts/docs/tests
- Homelab paths (`OF`, internal mount names), real NC prefixes beyond `Photos` / `example.com`
- `required-category-tags`, snippet files, or post-update output that prints tag definitions

## Sanitize / taxonomy

- Code: generic rules only (e.g. `outdoor`/`indoor`) + optional JSON file path `PHOTOTAG_SANITIZE_RULES` (file lives **only** on server / private `doku/` — **never** commit rule JSON or examples to GitHub)

## Before push

- `grep` repo for private tag IDs from your taxonomy
- `pytest -q`, `AGENTS.md` policy
- Optional: `Safe-CLI-Helpers/tools/scan-agents-public.ps1 -Repo phototag`
